  "content": "[Intro]\n[C]  [Dm]\n[Em]  [Dm]\n[C]  [Dm]\n[Em]  [Dm]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[C]We went to the [Dm]youth club And we\n[Em]looked out of [Dm]place\n[C]I didn't know where [Dm]to look So I\n[Em]looked at your [Dm]face\n[C]But you were a [Dm]boxing champ And\n[Em]I was a [Dm]weakling\n[C]You didn't give [Dm]me a chance\n[Em]You gave me a [Dm]beating And I\nthank you very much that you did\n[G]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[C]And as the [Dm]time went by We\n[Em]stayed out of [Dm]trouble\n[C]Before I could [Dm]realize\n[Em]My age had [Dm]doubled The\n[Am]man I became is a [G]tragic bore And\n[F]he's not a boxing champ [Em]anymore If there's\n[Am]one thing I've learned, it's to [G]run away At\n[F]least I enjoy what I [Em]do today And I\n[F]thank you very much that I do\n[G]\n\n[Outro]\n[C]  [Dm]\n[Em]  [Dm]\n[C]  [Dm]\n[Em]  [Dm]\n[C]",
